  "title": "Scott and Mark learn...how agents reshape software engineering",
  "description": "AI is changing how software is created—and what it means to be a software engineer. We’ll explore how AI agents are reshaping development: where they accelerate progress, where they fall short, and what’s changing for the profession. Along the way, we’ll share failure modes, lessons learned, and propose ways engineers and organizations can adapt. Real talk, no hype.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
